% cold_reader_reading↔frame_independence_reading: cold_reader_reading holds that supplying standing project framing to the reviewer is correct and necessary (it raises fidelity to the successor's real starting condition); frame_independence_reading holds that supplying that same framing is the specific and sufficient condition that destroys the check's validity ('a reader handed my standing rules is a reader I have already told what to look for'). No single coherent design criterion can treat injection of the rule file as simultaneously validity-preserving and validity-destroying for the same artifact under review; a framework must pick one governing purpose for the seat, which is exactly the author's own diagnosis of the original design error.

